      <description><![CDATA[
        A federal judge has officially dismissed the lawsuit filed against OpenAI CEO Sam Altman by his sister, closing a deeply personal legal battle.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The dismissal was triggered by the plaintiff&#39;s failure to appear for a mandated independent medical examination and missed legal deadlines.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The Altman family previously issued a joint statement vehemently denying the allegations when the suit was initially filed last year.
