      <description><![CDATA[
        Google&#39;s Gemini AI is stepping off your phone and into your dashboard. With new Personal Intelligence integration, your car can now pull flight data from Gmail and navigate using your personal photo library.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Drivers can execute complex voice commands such as fetching flight status from email confirmations or navigating to locations extracted from personal photos.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Major automotive partners including Ford, GM, Honda, Nissan, Volvo, and Polestar are integrating native Google vehicle architectures.
